  "verdict": "revise",
  "issues": [
    "Scope: The fraction was computed after dropping rows with `biomarker_baseline == -999`, which removes some patients from the denominator. The question asks for the fraction of *enrolled* patients, i.e., all unique patients, regardless of biomarker missingness.",
    "Unacknowledged data problem: The impact of excluding the -999 rows on the denominator is not discussed. If a patient’s only record has `biomarker_baseline == -999`, that patient is omitted, biasing the estimate."
